    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a thrilling fantasy sci-fi adventure as a courageous little fox! Team up with your animal and alien allies to battle relentless robot foes, journey across incredible vistas, and discover miraculous stories to save your planet from an intergalactic space invasion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/760cb1b947c3587e917cd3724664692b.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>You are a small fox in a vast medieval world teeming with other animals. You live peacefully in your quiet village, yet always dream of the larger world beyond. You've often imagined the wonders and dangers that lie beyond your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/fc235565d64d2cac599d0caf110563f1.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>But on one fateful day, during a joyous celebration in the kingdom\u2019s bustling capital, your world is forever shattered. An alien armada, thousands-strong and hailing from the farthest reaches of the galaxy, descend upon your planet. With it brings the horrors of  intergalactic war to your doorstep\u2014one that threatens to wipe out all life on your planet and galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/0d60ed45c60fc18d0f31fffc8ce99ee0.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>To save your world from extinction, you must embark on an epic journey across your planet\u2019s most treacherous and beautiful landscapes. Travel through scorching deserts, scale fiery peaks where dragon-kind dwell, explore the wealthiest lands, conquer the emerald shores, and brave forgotten tundras. Along the way, you'll gather a diverse group of allies, from brave animals to mysterious extraterrestrials, each with their own skills and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey you'll learn new ways to fight back against near-certain extinction. Through diverse sword combat ranging from scimitars to longswords, halberds, and more mixed with the wonders of alien technology- bubble shields, advanced targeting reticles, power attacks, and even laser pistols -you'll be able to conquer any foe in myriad ways. Facing an army? Call upon support like orbital bombardments, airstrikes, and even reinforcing ground support to take back your homeworld one robot at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/7e367752444a58957f87e2d8ac1ee6bf.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>This journey is not just about survival\u2014it's about preserving the history, culture, and spirit of your world. As you document the unique wonders of each region, you'll uncover ancient secrets and engage in thrilling battles against the ever-aggressive robot forces threatening all life everywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate character stories, filmic cutscenes, and character arcs with stakes that matter are throughout Foxtale. Learn the backstories of your animal friends through text-based dialogue trees, while your alien allies and robot foes are fully voiced and accurately motion-captured. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/4ac24c563f5b4b83218702004fabb8fb.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Every step of your adventure will challenge your courage, test your cunning, and push your limits as you fight to protect everything you hold dear. The fate of the world rests in your paws\u2014are you ready to rise to the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a thrilling fantasy sci-fi adventure as a courageous little fox! Team up with your animal and alien allies to battle relentless robot foes, journey across incredible vistas, and discover miraculous stories to save your planet from an intergalactic space invasion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/760cb1b947c3587e917cd3724664692b.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>You are a small fox in a vast medieval world teeming with other animals. You live peacefully in your quiet village, yet always dream of the larger world beyond. You've often imagined the wonders and dangers that lie beyond your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/fc235565d64d2cac599d0caf110563f1.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>But on one fateful day, during a joyous celebration in the kingdom\u2019s bustling capital, your world is forever shattered. An alien armada, thousands-strong and hailing from the farthest reaches of the galaxy, descend upon your planet. With it brings the horrors of  intergalactic war to your doorstep\u2014one that threatens to wipe out all life on your planet and galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/0d60ed45c60fc18d0f31fffc8ce99ee0.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>To save your world from extinction, you must embark on an epic journey across your planet\u2019s most treacherous 