ss=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215570/extras/4ac24c563f5b4b83218702004fabb8fb.webp?t=1740380347\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Every step of your adventure will challenge your courage, test your cunning, and push your limits as you fight to protect everything you hold dear. The fate of the world rests in your paws\u2014are you ready to rise to the challenge?</p>",
